      Data: 55|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: If true, the priority of the AudioSource will instantly be recalculated
        resulting in the lowest possible latency when reactivating after culling
        (useful for e.g. gunshots, explosions etc.). If false, the AudioSource will
        resume whenever the world audio system processes it again a few frames later.
        Enabling this may cause a minor hitch when multiple AudioSourceStateController
        are Started/Unpaused in the same frame.
